<title>THAILAND: Thailand approves branch upgrade of foreign banks.</title>
<headline>Thailand approves branch upgrade of foreign banks.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acting Thai Finance Minister Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi said on Thursday he had approved the upgrading of seven representative offices of foreign banks operating under the Bangkok International Banking Facility (BIBF) into full branches.</p>
</text>
